        "Content": "Ground Floor\r\nHall - (2.6m x 1.8m), Timber flooring.\r\nLiving Room - (4.5m x 3.2m), Timber flooring, stove.\r\nInner Hallway - (8.4m x 1.7m), Timber flooring, HP, storage.\r\nKitchen/Diner - (6.1m x 3.87m), Eye & Waist level units, timber flooring.\r\nUtility Room - (3.2m x 2m), Sink, plumbed for washing machine, tiled flooring.\r\nBedroom 1 - (4m x 3m), Timber flooring.\r\nBathroom - (3.2m x 3m), WC, WHB, bath, shower, dual access, timber flooring.\r\nBedroom 2 - (4.5m x 2.5m), Timber flooring, stairs to study.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\nStudy/Office - (4.5m x 2.5m), MDF flooring.\r\nStore Room - (4.5m x 3.7m), Timber Flooring.\r\n\r\nOutside: Shed- With power 4.2m x 2.8m/Workshop- 5.8m x 5.3m/Workshop 2/ Gym- With power 9.5m x 5.3m\r\nOutside WC- WC 2.4m x .9m.\r\nServices: Electricity, mains water, mains sewerage, oil fired central heating.\r\nBER: F Ber No: 119830321 Performance indicator: 328.16 Wh/m2/yr"
